<Project>

  <!--
    NuGet Central Package Management (CPM): this file is the single authoritative declaration of
    every package version used anywhere in this repository. Each project cites a package by name
    only, with no Version attribute, and the version is resolved from the matching entry below.
    Citing a version in a project file while CPM is switched on is an error (NU1008), which is
    precisely what makes version drift between projects structurally impossible.

    A dependency bump is therefore a one-line change reviewed in one place, rather than an audit
    of every project file in the solution.

    NU1507: CPM warns when more than one package source is configured, and because
    Directory.Build.props sets TreatWarningsAsErrors, that warning would fail the build. This
    repository resolves against exactly one source (nuget.org). Should a second source ever
    become necessary, the correct remedy is NuGet package source mapping - never relaxing the
    warning gate, and never suppressing the diagnostic.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>true</ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!--
    Test-only packages. The four production projects - Blitzy.LegacyPort.Core plus the GreeterApp,
    CalculatorApp, and UserApp console executables - cite zero packages, so the ported business
    logic carries no third-party surface whatsoever and Core resolves to nothing but a framework
    reference on Microsoft.NETCore.App. The sole consumer of the versions below is
    tests/Blitzy.LegacyPort.Core.Tests.

    Every version is an exact, deterministic pin read back from a resolved restore graph - never a
    floating range, never a wildcard, never a moving target - and deliberately current rather than
    the older floors an SDK test template would emit. Transitive dependencies are intentionally
    left unpinned; NuGet resolves the full closure from these four roots.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageVersion Include="Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk" Version="18.8.1" />
    <PackageVersion Include="xunit" Version="2.9.3" />
    <PackageVersion Include="xunit.runner.visualstudio" Version="3.1.5" />
    <PackageVersion Include="coverlet.collector" Version="10.0.1" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
